id: evil-saiyan-focused-evil
name: Focused Evil
order: 4
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
description: >
  By directing the darkness inside you, you take control over your battle lust and become a fine-tuned weapon of destruction.
text: >
  Focused Evil: By directing the darkness inside you, you take control over your battle lust and become a fine-tuned weapon of destruction.
  (1)-[Passive]: Your maximum number of Evil Points is 15(bT).
  (2)-[Passive]: Ignore the second effect of the Surging State.
  (3)-[Passive]: While this Transformation is used in conjunction with another Transformation that has the 'Saiyan' Racial Requirement, increase the Dice Score of your Steadfast Checks by 1.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you knock an Opponent with a Combat Condition through a Health Threshold, gain 5(bT) Evil Points.
  (5)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Target all Opponents within a Sphere AoE (centered on you). Make a Clash (Cognitive vs Cognitive/Morale) against those Opponents. If you win, they gain the Shaken Combat Condition until the start of your next turn.

